and continue challenging opponents.

17
00:00:48,680 --> 00:00:49,840
Continue until the song ends.

18
00:00:49,840 --> 00:00:52,280
The team that makes
fewer substitutions wins.

19
00:00:52,280 --> 00:00:54,240
