(Banana peel: Huang Jingyu)

553
00:17:53,840 --> 00:17:54,480
Ammo.

554
00:17:54,480 --> 00:17:55,520
Nature's gift.

555
00:17:59,660 --> 00:18:00,540
(Night vision mode)

556
00:18:00,560 --> 00:18:01,120
Watch your head!

557
00:18:02,100 --> 00:18:02,940
(Got the banana)

558
00:18:02,940 --> 00:18:04,360
(Banana peel and Banana: Huang Jingyu)

559
00:18:04,360 --> 00:18:06,000
He's got two rounds of ammo.

560
00:18:06,000 --> 00:18:07,880
I didn't dare jump at him.

561
00:18:08,120 --> 00:18:10,220
(Scared for real)
I'm telling you.

562
00:18:11,640 --> 00:18:13,080
Survival comes first.

563
00:18:13,080 --> 00:18:14,760
It's not that we lack courage.

564
00:18:14,760 --> 00:18:15,720
We're just playing smart.

565
00:18:17,580 --> 00:18:22,580
(Night vision mode)

566
00:18:22,580 --> 00:18:24,720
(Taking cautious steps)

567
00:18:24,720 --> 00:18:25,480
So quiet.

568
00:18:25,740 --> 00:18:26,360
(Locating by sound)

569
00:18:26,360 --> 00:18:27,440
Communicating in the dark.

570
00:18:28,900 --> 00:18:29,960
(Inching closer, backing away)

571
00:18:29,960 --> 00:18:31,200
This is going to be...

572
00:18:31,200 --> 00:18:32,200
Interesting.

573
00:18:32,420 --> 00:18:37,620
(Banana peel: Huang Jingyu)

574
00:18:37,760 --> 00:18:38,960
What a stylish exit.

575
00:18:39,980 --> 00:18:40,860
(Lights out)

576
00:18:40,900 --> 00:18:42,380
(No one dares approach)

577
00:18:44,520 --> 00:18:45,200
So scary.

578
00:18:45,680 --> 00:18:46,760
The whole point of this game

579
00:18:46,760 --> 00:18:47,680
has changed now.

580
00:18:49,160 --> 00:18:50,720
Huang Jingyu taking out two older guys.

581
00:18:55,060 --> 00:18:57,220
(Teng, are you still there?)

582
00:19:02,380 --> 00:19:03,540
(Lights out)

583
00:19:03,540 --> 00:19:04,860
(Banana peel: Huang Jingyu)

584
00:19:05,540 --> 00:19:08,220
(Desperately seeking an escape plan)

585
00:19:08,680 --> 00:19:09,080
I'm...

586
00:19:09,080 --> 00:19:10,560
I'm the old guy he's targeting.

587
00:19:10,560 --> 00:19:12,040
(Banana peel: Huang Jingyu)

588
00:19:12,040 --> 00:19:13,240
Good taste.

589
00:19:14,380 --> 00:19:16,300
(Narrow escape)

590
00:19:16,900 --> 00:19:17,460
(Night vision mode)

591
00:19:17,460 --> 00:19:18,420
(Attack successful)

592
00:19:19,220 --> 00:19:20,380
(Shen Teng eliminated)

593
00:19:20,580 --> 00:19:21,700
(Only two players left,
Banana peel: Huang Jingyu)

594
00:19:27,180 --> 00:19:28,420
(Lights out)

595
00:19:32,480 --> 00:19:33,440
He hasn't eaten it, right?

596
00:19:33,440 --> 00:19:33,800
He has.

597
00:19:33,800 --> 00:19:34,480
He's armed now.

598
00:19:35,400 --> 00:19:36,080
Another round of ammo.

599
00:19:36,080 --> 00:19:36,920
One more round.

600
00:19:36,940 --> 00:19:38,300
(New banana added)

601
00:19:38,460 --> 00:19:39,580
(Lights out)

602
00:19:40,980 --> 00:19:42,500
(Banana peel misses Bing)

603
00:19:42,500 --> 00:19:45,560
(Banana peel: Huang Jingyu,
Banana: Jia Bing)

604
00:19:45,560 --> 00:19:46,600
He's not out. Not yet.

605
00:19:47,280 --> 00:19:47,920
Come on!

606
00:19:48,580 --> 00:19:49,700
(Lights out)

607
00:19:51,340 --> 00:19:52,380
(Both attack at once)

608
00:19:55,080 --> 00:19:55,920
Finished eating?

609
00:19:55,920 --> 00:19:56,280
It's over.

610
00:19:56,860 --> 00:19:57,540
(Banana swallowed)

611
00:20:00,220 --> 00:20:01,740
(Can't believe his eyes)

612
00:20:02,240 --> 00:20:03,640
How did he do that?

613
00:20:03,640 --> 00:20:05,480
Were the lights even off
for half a second?

614
00:20:05,580 --> 00:20:06,560
(Night vision mode)
You haven't touched me yet.

615
00:20:06,560 --> 00:20:07,600
(What happened in the dark?)
Depends how fast you eat!

616
00:20:07,600 --> 00:20:08,660
(Banana in his mouth)

617
00:20:09,520 --> 00:20:10,400
He can really eat.

618
00:20:10,420 --> 00:20:11,700
(Swallows it as soon as
the lights come on)

619
00:20:12,440 --> 00:20:13,560
He even ate the peel.

620
00:20:13,660 --> 00:20:14,380
(Going all out)

621
00:20:14,520 --> 00:20:15,760
So are we both out?

622
00:20:16,320 --> 00:20:17,040
He didn't finish it.

623
00:20:18,760 --> 00:20:19,480
So fast.

624
00:20:19,480 --> 00:20:20,720
Did you shove it down?

625
00:20:21,340 --> 00:20:22,560
(That's our Bing)

626
00:20:22,560 --> 00:20:24,680
Since Bing didn't finish the banana,

627
00:20:24,680 --> 00:20:25,640
Jingyu wins.

628
00:20:26,000 --> 00:20:26,480
Jingyu wins.

629
00:20:26,480 --> 00:20:27,480
(Huang Jingyu wins)

630
00:20:27,480 --> 00:20:28,320
Mr. Huang.

631
00:20:32,360 --> 00:20:34,120
Don't challenge Jingyu
in games like this.

632
00:20:34,120 --> 00:20:34,600
Seriously.

633
00:20:34,600 --> 00:20:35,640
I didn't even dare grab it.
